{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5399","id":4538266147,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABDoByIw","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5399","diff_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5399.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/5399.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5399","number":5399,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(request): isolate failed formData cache so other body methods can succeed","user":{"login":"tahiraltundag","id":98649118,"node_id":"U_kgDOBeFEHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98649118?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag","html_url":"https://github.com/tahiraltundag","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #5383\n\n**Problem:** `c.req.formData()` stored its rejected promise in `bodyCache` unconditionally (`bodyCache[key] = raw[key]()`). The fallback that reuses any cached body (`for (...in bodyCache) return bodyCache[anyCachedKey].then(... Response[ key]())`) then handed the same rejection to every other body method. A `try { await formData } catch { await json }` fallback was impossible and the request ended 500.\n\nRaw `Request` body is also marked `bodyUsed` after the first read, so even deleting the rejected entry is not enough — `raw.json()` would still fail with `Body is unusable`.\n\n**Fix:** \n- Do not keep a rejected entry: `delete bodyCache[key]` on rejection and make the fallback loop skip a rejected entry.\n- Preserve raw bytes via a pre-read `raw.clone().arrayBuffer()` so a later representation can be rebuilt from `arrayBuffer` even after `bodyUsed` becomes true (clone is taken before the first read).\n\nVerified with reproduction (JSON body, `Content-Type: application/json`):\n```ts\nawait c.req.formData() // throws as expected\nawait c.req.json() // now returns {event:'push'} instead of throwing\n// app returns 200 instead of 500\n```\nExisting `src/request.test.ts` baseline unchanged (46 pass, 4 pre-existing fails due to bun fetch differences).","created_at":"2026-09-15T14:45:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T07:50:51Z","closed_at":"2026-09-15T22:57:45Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a0a4ab1c8637ea8d438930c50ae678b9d79a1154","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5399/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/5399/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/5399/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/statuses/c192f0fbedb2733ade8c291bc9f8a4e5bbe3b07e","head":{"label":"tahiraltundag:fix/hono-formdata-cache","ref":"fix/hono-formdata-cache","sha":"c192f0fbedb2733ade8c291bc9f8a4e5bbe3b07e","user":{"login":"tahiraltundag","id":98649118,"node_id":"U_kgDOBeFEHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98649118?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag","html_url":"https://github.com/tahiraltundag","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tahiraltundag/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.